      "role": "user",
      "content": "I know, I know. I've seen the risk assessment. The thing is, I'm worried that if we're too transparent about the pending challenge on the data processing patent, they're gonna use it as leverage to tank our valuation way below the $1.2B mark. \n\nIf I'm in the room and they ask point-blank if there are any active legal challenges against our core IP, how do you suggest I handle that? Do I need to lay it all out there, or is there a way to characterize it that doesn't blow the deal?",
